            "preview": "// --- Full-precision round-trip --- // The coordinates should encode to exactly FULL_PRECISION_HASH. assertEquals(FULL_PRECISION_HASH, GeohashUtils.encodeLatLon(ROUNDTRIP_LAT, ROUNDTRIP_LON));"
